  "notes": [
    "Snapshots were read from exact commits; source working trees were not modified.",
    "Verbatim files are checked against original SHA-256. Adapted targets retain source hashes and have independent regression evidence.",
    "New demo texts and host tools are independent of the four original stories.",
    "0.2 adds a self-developed interpreter, scheduler, renderer and standalone builder; legacy source projects remain unchanged.",
    "0.2.1 optimizes engine internals only. Source-game migration is explicitly gated on the user actively requesting it.",
    "0.3 adds original editor and Windows host code; the host uses the same self-developed engine and migration remains explicitly user-gated."
  ],
